ings are subject to change, Expect Bugs! \n\nControls 🎮:\n[F] - To use Ability (B for Console)  \n[E] - To use another feature  (Y for Console)\n[Q] - To use another feature (X for Console)\n\n⚠️ Exploiting = Permanent Ban!!","path":"/game/80150842900791-hammers","slug":"80150842900791-hammers","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/900b7da0e425fc54e6477636025f68e491d2f1cf87c8a2dfd02e137d2db99db2.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-46e6f34133e3affdc9520f402240a899/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":21,"visitor":11633594,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-08-03T18:30:43.011Z","creator":{"name":"Hammers.","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":16370122705,"name":"[TRADING FIXED + SALE] YBA: Reborn","desc":"USE CODE \"Prestige3\" FOR MAX LEVEL\n\nWelcome to YBA: Reborn, this a PvP orientated game that focuses on smooth and quality combat. Talk to Giorno Giovanna when you spawn in to begin the storyline, where you'll learn the game and earn cosmetic rewards on the way.\n\nCONTROLS (You can change some of these in your settings)\nQ - Summon stand (Requires a stand)\nF - Block\nP - Pose\nLeft Alt - Dash\nLeft Control - Start running","path":"/game/16370122705-yba-reborn","slug":"16370122705-yba-reborn","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/fb7fc396800ea45b1215a65f70648d5c8daed25647cc6ddd810113e813a4b138.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d966f7dcc2dff1b8d3020ceb4915735e/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":21,"visitor":1861243,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-06-29T11:26:06.575Z","creator":{"name":"1Pob1","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7647631063,"name":"💫 Guess The Anime!","desc":"Guess the Anime!\n🗺️ | Complete all the quizzes and become the top otakus in the game!\n\n👍 | Please, like this game so I can be excited to keep updating this game!\n🔔 | Make sure to hit the FOLLOW button to be notified of new updates!\n\n🏷️ | Tag