nce. MODERN VIDEO GAMES. not at all conducive to the collective vision of what we call \"Gamers\", to which we acknowledge their plead in these dastardly times. In return, we have formed an art piece from their collective mindset forged from Sisyphean decades of spilt blood and tears. Your efforts to human evolution have not gone to waste, Gamers, for we present to you: BE DEAD FOREVER SIMULATOR.\n\n\"Be Dead Forever Simulator isn't just a game, it's an experience, a memorable experience that I will be telling my grand children about. 9/10\" - IGN\n\n\"i did not say that bruh\" - not IGN","path":"/game/2882332175-be-dead-forever-simulator","slug":"2882332175-be-dead-forever-simulator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/5932bcca3f69fbf4593d052e1157f7a966357cd073e4dac5d1db40e91d9d6369.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-abac5e74a9f31502bd0de0a17299ae6b/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":20,"visitor":154130096,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-10T07:18:53.135Z","creator":{"name":"mad_hhhh","type":"User"},"script":{"count":9,"freeCount":9,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":482742811,"name":"BE CRUSHED BY A SPEEDING WALL","desc":"The title says it all, press the button and be crushed by a speeding wall!\n\nAs you play you earn points for making it to safe zones and oof'ing. You will oof A LOT! Use these points to buy gears to upgrade your speed in an attempt to defeat the wall!\n\nBased off NintendoZACHERY's classic game!","path":"/game/482742811-be-crushed-by-a-speeding-wall","slug":"482742811-be-crushed-by-a-speeding-wall","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/182a99b50c65fbc0d6ff4abea7d6096e3bf6a5a5067f0763339fcc9325b52e38.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-63f3b6f5a13a9bd8115ab8e6af76ae46/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":20,"visitor":707891644,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-15T20:57:11.046Z","creator":{"name":"Bobbysayhi","type":"User"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":510411669,"name":"Fantastic Frontier","desc":"Fantastic Frontier's Spring Update [v1.3] arrives! Featuring a huge new island to explore and collect from, with new weapons and armor, 2 new houses, a new task-giver, long requested balance changes and more!\nTo get to the Island purchase the new Boathouse, just south of the Blue Ogre Camp.\n\nCheck the Official groups for the exact balance changes this patch.\n\n----\n\nOfficial Group: www.roblox.com/groups/group.aspx?gid=3352883\n\nFantastic Frontier is an action adventure game where you can fight monsters, fish, gather rare collectibles, hunt birds and more! Loot you find can be used to upgrade your character, buy a home and become a legendary hero! \n\n🐭 If you'd like to support us please like and favorite the game! 🐸","path":"/game/510411669-fantastic-frontier","slug":"510411669-fantastic-frontier","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4d3699ed6467e70ad0d92188b3adeb752888303314cd865c5c649159610f6a60.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3022e9059e4b4d7ae1e5507f1837d6b3/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":20,"visitor":35212560,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-05-19T11:06:11.095Z","creator":{"name":"Spectrabox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":2}},{"id":2960777560,"name":"Treasure Quest","desc":"⚔️ Welcome to Treasure Quest! Loot treasure, battle monsters, and complete unique quests as you and your friends become the ultimate treasure hunters! Fight as a Wizard, Warrior, or Archer in over a dozen unique dungeons!\n\n⭐️ How To Play:\n- Press the PLAY button to create a dungeon!\n- Defeat bosses for new weapons & loot!\n- Upgrade your weapons & skills to grow stronger!\n- Level up to unlock new dungeons & other features!\n\n🎮 Controls:\n- Desktop: Click to attack, F to use your ability, & LShift to sprint!\n- Mobile: Tap to attack, use your ability, & sprint!\n- XBOX: X to attack, Y to use your ability, & LB to sprint!\n- Playstation: Square to attack